ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp066: EDGE_CURVE with degree-3 B-spline 3D curve (knots 0–3) and linear PCURVE; FixSameParameter picks first-exceeds-Precision::Confusion tolerance instead of minimum feasible tolerance; suboptimal tolerance selection leaves larger-than-necessary deviation; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
